empty\",\n944:           \"json.bookmark_save.category.whitespace\",\n945:           \"json.bookmark_save.category.overlong_121\",\n946:           \"json.bookmark_move.category.empty\",\n947:           \"json.bookmark_move.category.whitespace\",\n948:           \"json.bookmark_move.category.overlong_121\",\n949:           \"json.bookmark_move.category.omitted\",\n950:           \"json.bookmark_move.category.null\"\n951:         ],\n952:         \"failure\": \"空/超长/非法归类 400 invalid_category，未知 record_id 404 not_found；不移动、不写入。\",\n953:         \"feature_id\": \"F04\",\n954:         \"navigation\": \"成功后 303 到 /?category=<目标归类> 或来源视图。\",\n955:         \"recovery\": \"保留选择并显示 form-error；用户改选有效归类或返回列表重试。\",\n956:         \"success_state\": \"303 回列表；记录离开原归类并出现在目标归类，JSON 的 category 与持久化结果一致。\"\n957:       },\n958:       {\n959:         \"acceptance_ids\": [\n960:           \"A06\"\n961:         ],\n962:         \"action\": \"点击归类链接或从搜索表单选择归类并查看列表。\",\n963:         \"design_basis\": \"场景验收 4：用户通过归类浏览找回记录；来源标签计数被调整为按归类聚合。\",\n964:         \"entry\": \"首页侧栏 [data-testid=category-count][data-category-id] 与归类链接；/categories 同显计数；GET /?category=<name>。\",\n965:         \"failure\": \"未知归类返回空结果而非 5xx；计数查询失败显示错误页。\",\n966:         \"feature_id\": \"F05\",\n967:         \"navigation\": \"GET /?category=... 或 GET /categories；无记录时显示明确空状态。\",\n968:         \"recovery\": \"选择其他归类或清空筛选。\",\n969:         \"success_state\": \"页面只列该归类活动记录；HTML count 与 JSON count 都等于活动（未软删）记录数；移动、删除、恢复后仍一致。\"\n970:       },\n971:       {\n972:         \"acceptance_ids\": [\n973:           \"A07\"\n974:         ],\n975:         \"action\": \"选择归类、输入关键字并提交。\",\n976:         \"design_basis\": \"场景验收 4：用户凭记得的关键字找回已存链接；来源仅搜标题，目标扩展到可识别来源的字段。\",\n977:         \"entry\": \"首页 form[data-testid=category-search-form]，字段 category（归类名）与 q；action 为 GET /。\",\n978:         \"failure\": \"无匹配不是错误（200 + 空结果）；非法请求返回可读错误且不写入。\",\n979:         \"feature_id\": \"F06\",\n980:         \"navigation\": \"GET /?category=...&q=...，同一页面更新结果。\",\n981:         \"recovery\": \"修改 q 或切换归类重新提交；清空 q 恢复归类浏览。\",\n982:         \"success_state\": \"URL 与表单保留 category 与 q；页面显示所选归类、保留查询和匹配行；同一关键字在两个归类分别命中各自记录；无匹配显示明确空结果；JSON 返回匹配集。\"\n983:       },\n984:       {\n985:         \"acceptance_ids\": [\n986:           \"A08\"\n987:         ],\n988:         \"action\": \"用户点击打开链接。\",\n989:         \"design_basis\": \"场景验收 2 与 workflow 5：打开记录即回到保存时的外部网页，库只保证引用而非内容。\",\n990:         \"entry\": \"记录行 a[data-testid=record-open-link] 与 GET /go/{id}。\",\n991:         \"failure\": \"未知 id 404 not_found；目标不可达不影响库中记录可读。\",\n992:         \"feature_id\": \"F07\",\n993:         \"navigation\": \"浏览器导航到原始 URL（新标签）；服务端只发 302。\",\n994:         \"recovery\": \"返回收藏列表选择其他记录；如 URL 有误，可由现有 PATCH API 更新并重算 hostname。\",\n995:         \"success_state\": \"链接 href 恰为保存时原始 URL，target=_blank、rel 含 noopener；GET /go/{id} 302 Location 为同一字符串；P0 不请求目标页。\"\n996:       },\n997:       {\n998:         \"acceptance_ids\": [\n999:           \"A01\",\n1000:           \"A05\",\n1001:           \"A09\"\n1002:         ],\n1003:         \"action\": \"执行真实写操作，停止应用进程，再以同一实例目录重启并读取。\",\n1004:         \"design_basis\": \"场景验收 1：主动保存的链接在多次会话之间持久保留；目标以 SQLite 实现本地单用户持久化。\",\n1005:         \"entry\": \"保存、移动、删除/恢复等写操作后重新请求页面；重启适配器从同一 app_root 与实例数据目录启动。\",\n1006:         \"failure\": \"数据库不可写或损坏时返回明确 5xx 错误页而非成功假象；事务回滚保持旧状态。\",\n1007:         \"feature_id\": \"F08\",\n1008:         \"navigation\": \"无自动导航；下次 GET / 读取持久状态。\",\n1009:         \"recovery\": \"恢复可写数据目录后重试；重启应用重新初始化 schema。\",\n1010:         \"success_state\": \"重启后 id、原始 URL、标题、描述、归类与 trashed 状态与写入后一致；HTML 与 JSON 都来自 SQLite。\"\n1011:       },\n1012:       {\n1013:         \"acceptance_ids\": [\n1014:           \"A09\"\n1015:         ],\n1016:         \"action\": \"提交 record_id 软删除；在回收站提交 record_id 恢复。\",\n1017:         \"design_basis\": \"场景要求可恢复的失败；来源仅有归档记录的瞬时 Undo，目标改为显式软删除与恢复。\",\n1018:         \"entry\": \"记录行 form[data-testid=record-delete-form]；GET /?trash=1 的软删记录行 form[data-testid=record-restore-form]。\",\n1019:         \"failure\": \"未知 record_id 404 not_found；失败不改变 trashed_at，不产生 5xx。\",\n1020:         \"feature_id\": \"F09\",\n1021:         \"navigation\": \"删除成功 303 到 /?trash=1；恢复成功 303 到恢复后归类。\",\n1022:         \"recovery\": \"回收站提供可提交的恢复表单；失败可重试或返回列表。\",\n1023:         \"success_state\": \"默认视图与计数排除软删记录，回收站仍显示；恢复后原始字段与归类回归并重新可见；归类删除后软删记录仍在「未整理」可恢复。\"\n1024:       },\n1025:       {\n1026:         \"acceptance_ids\": [\n1027:           \"A02\",\n1028:           \"A10\",\n1029:           \"A12\"\n1030:         ],\n1031:         \"action\": \"提交非法 URL、空/超长/非法归类、畸形 JSON 或未知 ID。\",\n1032:         \"design_basis\": \"场景要求非法输入可恢复；源表单校验被调整为服务端 HTML 表单与 JSON API 共用的显式错误合同。\",\n1033:         \"entry\": \"所有 HTML 表单（保存、归类、移动、删除、恢复、搜索）与 JSON API 端点。\",\n1034:         \"error_branch_ids\": [\n1035:           \"html.bookmark_save.category.empty\",\n1036:           \"html.bookmark_save.category.whitespace\",\n1037:           \"html.bookmark_save.category.overlong_121\",\n1038:           \"html.bookmark_move.category_id.omitted\",\n1039:           \"html.bookmark_move.category_id.empty\",\n1040:           \"html.bookmark_move.category_id.unknown_id\",\n1041:           \"json.bookmark_save.category.empty\",\n1042:           \"json.bookmark_save.category.whitespace\",\n1043:           \"json.bookmark_save.category.overlong_121\",\n1044:           \"json.bookmark_move.category.empty\",\n1045:           \"json.bookmark_move.category.whitespace\",\n1046:           \"json.bookmark_move.category.overlong_121\",\n1047:           \"json.bookmark_move.category.omitted\",\n1048:           \"json.bookmark_move.category.null\"\n1049:         ],\n1050:         \"failure\": \"出现 5xx、静默写入或不可恢复的错误页即视为失败。\",\n1051:         \"feature_id\": \"F10\",\n1052:         \"navigation\": \"HTML 错误留在当前表单页并保留输入；JSON 无导航。\",\n1053:         \"recovery\": \"修正字段后重新提交；失败页保留可运行的表单或返回链接。\",\n1054:         \"success_state\": \"错误路径本身成功执行：JSON 返回 400/404/409 与结构化错误码，HTML 返回 400/409 与 form-error；畸形 JSON 为 bad_request；均无\n1055: 5xx、无写入。\"\n1056:       },\n1057:       {\n1058:         \"acceptance_ids\": [\n1059:           \"A11\"\n1060:         ],\n1061:         \"action\": \"首启或空库时打开首页。\",\n1062:         \"design_basis\": \"场景是单用户本地工具，需要可打开的应用入口；目标采用 Python 服务端渲染外壳而非来源 SPA。\",\n1063:         \"entry\": \"GET / 与 GET /api/health。\",\n1064:         \"failure\": \"健康检查非 200/非 JSON、首页 5xx 或缺少表单时显式失败。\",\n1065:         \"feature_id\": \"F11\",\n1066:         \"navigation\": \"无自动导航（首页即入口）；可进入 /categories 或归类筛选。\",\n1067:         \"recovery\": \"启动或重启应用；修复后刷新首页。\",\n1068:         \"success_state\": \"200 text/html；含保存表单 name=url、归类管理链接、记录列表/空状态容器；预置归类与空库不报错；health 200 JSON。\"\n1069:       }\n1070:     ],\n1071:     \"review_rules_version\": \"atlas.current-required-contract.v1\",\n1072:     \"schema\": \"atlas.contract-coverage.v1\"\n1073:   },\n1074:   \"decisions\": [\n1075:     {\n1076:       \"default\": \"单选归类（bookmark.category_id 标量外键）。场景流程明确“选择一个简单归类”，单归属让移动、计数与浏览语义无歧义；未来若需多值可迁移到关联表而不丢数据。\",\n1077:       \"id\": \"D01\",\n1078:       \"impact\": \"决定数据模型（标量外键 vs 关联表）以及浏览、计数与检索的实现路径。\",\n1079:       \"question\": \"记录应归属于单一“归类”，还是允许像标签一样同时属于多个？\",\n1080:       \"status\": \"decided\",\n1081:       \"when_to_ask\": \"当真实用户反馈同一条记录必须同时属于多个主题，或需要跨主题交叉检索时再评估多标签。\"\n1082:     },\n1083:     {\n[Output truncated. Continue reading with offset: 1084]"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\": \"/Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/application-atlas-production-pack/atlas/template-factory/jobs/job_7742b1c124be4c9ab3a0096da5cdd772/attempt-3/blueprint-spec-review-0-bbc43771a1bbbe99-runtime_protocol-v1/source/DRAFT.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1792432514352,"end":1792432515961}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1792432515962,"sessionID":"ses_eaab26edeffe6i68cx2YgCxL3M","part":{"partID":"prt_1554da60c0010xHM4t2HeMp09M","sessionID":"ses_eaab26edeffe6i68cx2YgCxL3M","messageID":"msg_1554d9f59001f40AnYC4VjprWQ","type":"tool","id":"call_01_cb65tqahrwg1epo7fj94byjw","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/application-atlas-production-pack/atlas/template-factory/jobs/job_7742b1c124be4c9ab3a0096da5cdd772/attempt-3/blueprint-spec-review-0-bbc43771a1bbbe99-runtime_protocol-v1/source/ARCHITECTURE.md"},"output":"Read file /Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/application-atlas-production-pack/atlas/template-factory/jobs/job_7742b1c124be4c9ab3a0096da5cdd772/attempt-3/blueprint-spec-review-0-bbc43771a1bbbe99-runtime_protocol-v1/source/ARCHITECTURE.md, lines 1-83\n1: # 架构与契约\n2: \n3: ## 默认技术栈与理由\n4: \n5: - 交付 profile：python-web。Python 3.12 标准库（http.server、sqlite3、urllib、json、html.parser），零第三方依赖；服务端渲染 HTML 表单，JSON API 与 HTML 适配器共用同一服务层。\n6: - 备选 Flask/FastAPI 需安装依赖；Node + IndexedDB/SPA 需 npm/浏览器工具且把数据放在浏览器 profile。二者与离线、可独立验收、单用户本地库的约束冲突，故不采用。\n7: - 数据文件位于应用 `--data-dir/bookmarks.sqlite3`；验收的每实例隔离目录由测试适配器创建，测试者 `--data-dir` 根目录不是应用数据库。\n8: - 单用户、本地优先；无认证、无云同步。日常绑定 127.0.0.1；仅隔离验收网络使用 0.0.0.0。\n9: \n10: ## 数据模型（SQLite）\n11: \n12: - `schema_meta(version INTEGER)`：迁移版本单行。启动时在一个事务内创建/升级 schema，v1 建表并写入预置归类；版本演进只通过事务化迁移，不回退、不依赖客户端存储。\n13: - `categories(id TEXT PRIMARY KEY, name TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE COLLATE NOCASE, is_default INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0, position INTEGER NOT NULL, created_at INTEGER NOT NULL)`：首启预置「未整理」(is_default=1)、「待购」、「家居改造」、「以后看看」。\n14: - `bookmarks(id TEXT PRIMARY KEY, url TEXT NOT NULL, hostname TEXT NOT NULL, title TEXT NULL, description TEXT NULL, category_id TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES categories(id), favicon_url TEXT NULL, created_at INTEGER NOT NULL, updated_at INTEGER NOT NULL, trashed_at INTEGER NULL)`。\n15: - 索引：category_id、created_at、hostname；url 不设唯一索引。P1/F14 的重复检测由服务层查询活动记录完成；P0 不启用重复拒绝。\n16: - trashed_at 为 NULL 表示活动记录；非 NULL 为软删除。默认列表与计数只统计 trashed_at IS NULL；恢复清空 trashed_at。删除归类在单一事务内把该归类下的活动记录与软删除记录都改到默认归类，因此恢复不会产生无归类记录。\n17: - 排序固定为 created_at DESC、id ASC；category 与 q 只作请求参数，不落库。\n18: \n19: ## URL 策略\n20: \n21: - 记录 URL 必须是绝对、可解析的 HTTP(S) URL，且 hostname 有效且非空。单标签主机（如 http://localhost）与 IP 字面量均有效；不做 DNS 查询、可达性检查或目标页抓取。\n22: - 保存与打开都保留用户提交的原始字符串（不补斜杠、不改大小写、不重写路径）；hostname 由解析结果派生。若 PATCH 更新 URL，必须用新 URL 重新派生 hostname。\n23: - 拒绝：缺少 scheme、非 http/https、缺少/非法 hostname、无法解析的字符串；返回 400 invalid_url 且不写入。\n24: - 上游 S04 的点域名正则与 S08 getHostname 是源观察，映射为 adjusted：点不是通用 URL 有效性要求；target 采用上述解析策略。\n25: - 保存、打开、抓取三者分离：P0 保存与列表均不请求目标页；打开只产生浏览器导航或 /go 302。\n26: \n27: ## API、错误与状态合同\n28: \n29: - `GET /api/health` → 200 JSON，含就绪与 schema 版本。\n30: - `GET /api/categories` → 200 数组，每项 id、name、count、is_default；count 只计活动记录。\n31: - `POST /api/categories` name → 201；重名 409 duplicate_category；空名或超过 120 字符 400 invalid_name。\n32: - `PATCH /api/categories/{id}` name → 200；同上校验；默认归类 400 protected_category。`DELETE /api/categories/{id}` → 200；默认归类 400 protected_category；否则事务内把活动与软删记录迁到默认归类。\n33: - `GET /api/bookmarks?category=<name|id>&q=<str>&include_trashed=0|1` → 200 数组；默认排序 created_at DESC、id ASC；q 对标题、hostname、描述做大小写不敏感子串匹配并与 category 叠加；未知归类返回空数组。\n34: - `POST /api/bookmarks` url 必填，title、description、category 可选，allow_duplicate 为 P1；201；category 省略/null 时归入默认「未整理」；显式空字符串或超过 120 字符 400 invalid_category；新名称按 NOCASE 自动创建并复用；非法 URL 400 invalid_url；P1 重复 409 duplicate_url 且附 existing_id。\n35: - `GET /api/bookmarks/{id}` 200 或 404 not_found；`PATCH` 更新字段；URL 变化时重算 hostname；非法 URL 400 invalid_url，非法归类 400 invalid_category；P1 重复 409 duplicate_url。`POST /api/bookmarks/{id}/move` body category 必填；省略/空/超长 400 invalid_category；新名称自动创建。`DELETE /api/bookmarks/{id}` 软删除 200；`POST /api/bookmarks/{id}/restore` 恢复；P1 同 URL 活动冲突 409 duplicate_url 且不改数据。\n36: - `GET /go/{id}` 302，Location 为保存时原始 URL；未知 id 404 not_found。HTML 打开链接使用原始 URL，target=_blank、rel=noopener。\n37: - P1：`GET /api/export` Netscape HTML；`POST /api/import` 同格式，返回 imported/skipped。\n38: - 错误合同：JSON 失败返回 `{error:{code,message,field}}`；通用 bad_request（畸形/不可解析 JSON，400）、invalid_url、invalid_category、invalid_name、not_found、duplicate_category、protected_category、duplicate_url。校验错误不产生 5xx，不产生部分写入；畸形 JSON 一律 bad_request 且不写。\n39: - 状态合同：GET 幂等；写操作事务化；校验失败保持提交前状态；分类与 q 为视图状态；删除与恢复改变 trashed_at 但不删除行。\n40: \n41: ## UI/HTML 适配器合同（供真实表单验收与独立浏览器执行者）\n42: \n43: - `GET /`：保存表单 `form[action=/bookmarks/new]`（method=post，字段 url/title/description/category；category 预填「未整理」）；`a[data-testid=category-manager]` 指向 /categories；`form[data-testid=category-search-form]` 为 GET /，含 select 或 input name=category（归类名）与 input name=q；记录行 `tr[data-testid=record-row][data-record-id]`；打开链接 `a[data-testid=record-open-link]` 的 href 必须等于保存时原始 URL，target=_blank，rel 含 noopener；每行含 `form[data-testid=record-move-form]`（input record_id、select name=category_id，值为 API 归类 ID）、`form[data-testid=record-delete-form]`（input record_id）；回收站或 `GET /?trash=1` 的软删记录行含 `form[data-testid=record-restore-form]`（input record_id）。\n44: - `GET /categories`：`form[data-testid=category-create-form]`（input name）、`form[data-testid=category-rename-form]`（input category_id、name）、`form[data-testid=category-delete-form]`（input category_id）；每个归类行/侧栏计数为 `[data-testid=category-count][data-category-id=...]`，只显示活动记录数；归类名/计数与 JSON 一致。\n45: - 表单成功：save 303 到 /?category=...；move 303 到目标归类；delete 303 到 /?trash=1；restore 303 到恢复后归类；category create/rename/delete 303 到 /categories。失败：400/409 渲染当前页，含 `[data-testid=form-error]` 可读消息，保留 url/title/description/category/name/category_id/record_id 中已提交的值，并保留可重新提交的表单；不得 5xx 或写入。\n46: - 归类搜索：提交 category 与 q，成功后 URL 与表单同时保留两者；页面显示所选归类、保留的查询和匹配行；同一关键字在两个归类分别得到各自结果；某归类无匹配时显示明确空结果，不是错误。\n47: - 记录移动由 HTML 适配器把 category_id 翻译成归类名，再调用现有 move 服务；归类删除仍按 API 事务迁移活动与软删记录。默认归类不可重命名/删除。\n48: - P0 不提供孤立的记录编辑界面；仅保留 PATCH /api/bookmarks/{id} 的现有 URL 更新合同（URL 变化重算 hostname）。打开链接的实际导航目标由 href 与 /go 302 双重验证，不抓取目标页。\n49: \n50: ## 验收适配器合同\n51: \n52: - 全部程序使用 `--base-url` 指向真实 python-web 目标；A01/A05/A09 另需 `--app-root` 与 `--data-dir`，A14 需 `--data-dir`。\n53: - `--app-root` 只读；`--data-dir` 是测试者草稿根。重启用例通过 common.launch_app 在同一 `--data-dir/instances/<id>` 上启动 `app/serve.py`，真实写入、SIGTERM、同一目录重启并读回；健康检查不是重启证据。\n54: - HTML 用例以标准库 urllib 提交 application/x-www-form-urlencoded 表单并解析响应 HTML 的 data-testid、表单字段、链接与文本；不以 API 调用代替声明的 HTML 表单，不驱动 JS/DOM。独立浏览器执行者可复用同一契约。\n55: - 所有请求限定在 base_url 精确 origin；/go 不跟随重定向；不请求保存的外链、元数据或 favicon；不附加凭据；目标要求认证时显式报告基础设施未就绪。\n56: - 结果：stdout 单个 atlas.acceptance-result.v1 JSON；断言失败或基础设施错误 exit nonzero；不声称已运行。\n57: \n58: ## 非功能需求\n59: \n60: - 离线可用：保存/浏览/检索不依赖外部服务；不设置外部抓取为 P0 要求。\n61: - 数据完整性：写事务化；归类删除与恢复保持引用完整；校验失败零写入。\n62: - 确定性：排序、错误码、重定向稳定；GET 幂等。\n63: - 可访问/可测试：语义化 HTML、表单 label 或 aria、稳定 data-testid；服务端输出 UTF-8。\n64: - 单用户本机：无认证；日常 127.0.0.1，0.0.0.0 仅隔离验收网络。\n65: - 不设未经验证的时延/吞吐/成本目标；只要求请求可顺序处理。\n66: \n67: ## 边界与限制\n68: \n69: - 不实现云同步、多设备、协作、分享、浏览器扩展/移动分享目标。\n70: - 不保存网页副本、不抓取正文、不做失效链接检测（F17/F18）。\n71: - 不引入置顶/归档/多排序/复制 URL/访问计数（F20/F23/F24）。\n72: - 归类为扁平单选；嵌套/标签属后期（F19/D12）。\n73: - P0 不做重复拒绝；F14/A15 保持 P1。\n74: - 第三方元数据/图标仅 P1 可选增强，失败不影响保存；离线验收不验证其可达性。\n75: \n76: ## A04/A12 分类输入澄清（本次受限修订）\n77: \n78: - A04 仅分类管理：HTML create/rename 表单的 name 与 JSON create/rename 的 name 同为归类名称；省略、空字符串、纯空白、121 字符均 400 invalid_name，JSON 显式 null 同样 invalid_name。既有重名 duplicate_category、默认分类 protected_category、删除迁移/恢复均保留。\n79: - A12 仅书签保存和移动，不将分类管理 name 校验混为 invalid_category。HTML 保存使用名称 category；省略时未整理，显式空/纯空白/121 字符为 400 invalid_category。HTML 无 JSON null 这种原生值，不能把字面字符串 null 当 JSON null。\n80: - JSON 保存使用名称 category；省略或显式 null 均默认未整理，显式空/纯空白/121 字符为 invalid_category。JSON move 的名称 category 必填；省略、null、空/纯空白/121 字符为 invalid_category。有效新名称可自动创建并复用，未知名称不等于非法 ID。\n81: - HTML move 使用 category_id（API 已有分类 ID），必须解析为已有名称再调用服务；省略、空或未知 ID 为 invalid_category，不能把未知 ID 当新名称创建。JSON 保存/move 合同不新增 category_id 字段；GET category 未知值的空结果语义不改。\n82: - 错误分支一律零写入：HTML 400、form-error 可读、保留已提交字段并提供可重试表单；JSON 400、error.code/message/field，无导航。成功流程、303 导航、阶段、能力与既有断言意图保留。\n83: - 搜索仍仅对 title、hostname、description 做大小写不敏感子串匹配，并叠加分类；不扩展为 URL 全文、分类名或标签检索。此处对齐目标设计，不更改案例来源观察。","title":"read","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read file /Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/application-atlas-production-pack/atlas/template-factory/jobs/job_7742b1c124be4c9ab3a0096da5cdd772/attempt-3/blueprint-spec-review-0-bbc43771a1bbbe99-runtime_protocol-v1/source/ARCHITECTURE.md, lines 1-83\n1: # 架构与契约\n2: \n3: ## 默认技术栈与理由\n4: \n5: - 交付 profile：python-web。Python 3.12 标准库（http.server、sqlite3、urllib、json、html.parser），零第三方依赖；服务端渲染 HTML 表单，JSON API 与 HTML 适配器共用同一服务层。\n6: - 备选 Flask/FastAPI 需安装依赖；Node + IndexedDB/SPA 需 npm/浏览器工具且把数据放在浏览器 profile。二者与离线、可独立验收、单用户本地库的约束冲突，故不采用。\n7: - 数据文件位于应用 `--data-dir/bookmarks.sqlite3`；验收的每实例隔离目录由测试适配器创建，测试者 `--data-dir` 根目录不是应用数据库。\n8: - 单用户、本地优先；无认证、无云同步。日常绑定 127.0.0.1；仅隔离验收网络使用 0.0.0.0。\n9: \n10: ## 数据模型（SQLite）\n11: \n12: - `schema_meta(version INTEGER)`：迁移版本单行。启动时在一个事务内创建/升级 schema，v1 建表并写入预置归类；版本演进只通过事务化迁移，不回退、不依赖客户端存储。\n13: - `categories(id TEXT PRIMARY KEY, name TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE COLLATE NOCASE, is_default INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0, position INTEGER NOT NULL, created_at INTEGER NOT NULL)`：首启预置「未整理」(is_default=1)、「待购」、「家居改造」、「以后看看」。\n14: - `bookmarks(id TEXT PRIMARY KEY, url TEXT NOT NULL, hostname TEXT NOT NULL, title TEXT NULL, description TEXT NULL, category_id TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES categories(id), favicon_url TEXT NULL, created_at INTEGER NOT NULL, updated_at INTEGER NOT NULL, trashed_at INTEGER NULL)`。\n15: - 索引：category_id、created_at、hostname；url 不设唯一索引。P1/F14 的重复检测由服务层查询活动记录完成；P0 不启用重复拒绝。\n16: - trashed_at 为 NULL 表示活动记录；非 NULL 为软删除。默认列表与计数只统计 trashed_at IS NULL；恢复清空 trashed_at。删除归类在单一事务内把该归类下的活动记录与软删除记录都改到默认归类，因此恢复不会产生无归类记录。\n17: - 排序固定为 created_at DESC、id ASC；category 与 q 只作请求参数，不落库。\n18: \n19: ## URL 策略\n20: \n21: - 记录 URL 必须是绝对、可解析的 HTTP(S) URL，且 hostname 有效且非空。单标签主机（如 http://localhost）与 IP 字面量均有效；不做 DNS 查询、可达性检查或目标页抓取。\n22: - 保存与打开都保留用户提交的原始字符串（不补斜杠、不改大小写、不重写路径）；hostname 由解析结果派生。若 PATCH 更新 URL，必须用新 URL 重新派生 hostname。\n23: - 拒绝：缺少 scheme、非 http/https、缺少/非法 hostname、无法解析的字符串；返回 400 invalid_url 且不写入。\n24: - 上游 S04 的点域名正则与 S08 getHostname 是源观察，映射为 adjusted：点不是通用 URL 有效性要求；target 采用上述解析策略。\n25: - 保存、打开、抓取三者分离：P0 保存与列表均不请求目标页；打开只产生浏览器导航或 /go 302。\n26: \n27: ## API、错误与状态合同\n28: \n29: - `GET /api/health` → 200 JSON，含就绪与 schema 版本。\n30: - `GET /api/categories` → 200 数组，每项 id、name、count、is_default；count 只计活动记录。\n31: - `POST /api/categories` name → 201；重名 409 duplicate_category；空名或超过 120 字符 400 invalid_name。\n32: - `PATCH /api/categories/{id}` name → 200；同上校验；默认归类 400 protected_category。`DELETE /api/categories/{id}` → 200；默认归类 400 protected_category；否则事务内把活动与软删记录迁到默认归类。\n33: - `GET /api/bookmarks?category=<name|id>&q=<str>&include_trashed=0|1` → 200 数组；默认排序 created_at DESC、id ASC；q 对标题、hostname、描述做大小写不敏感子串匹配并与 category 叠加；未知归类返回空数组。\n34: - `POST /api/bookmarks` url 必填，title、description、category 可选，allow_duplicate 为 P1；201；category 省略/null 时归入默认「未整理」；显式空字符串或超过 120 字符 400 invalid_category；新名称按 NOCASE 自动创建并复用；非法 URL 400 invalid_url；P1 重复 409 duplicate_url 且附 existing_id。\n35: - `GET /api/bookmarks/{id}` 200 或 404 not_found；`PATCH` 更新字段；URL 变化时重算 hostname；非法 URL 400 invalid_url，非法归类 400 invalid_category；P1 重复 409 duplicate_url。`POST /api/bookmarks/{id}/move` body category 必填；省略/空/超长 400 invalid_category；新名称自动创建。`DELETE /api/bookmarks/{id}` 软删除 200；`POST /api/bookmarks/{id}/restore` 恢复；P1 同 URL 活动冲突 409 duplicate_url 且不改数据。\n36: - `GET /go/{id}` 302，Location 为保存时原始 URL；未知 id 404 not_found。HTML 打开链接使用原始 URL，target=_blank、rel=noopener。\n37: - P1：`GET /api/export` Netscape HTML；`POST /api/import` 同格式，返回 imported/skipped。\n38: - 错误合同：JSON 失败返回 `{error:{code,message,field}}`；通用 bad_request（畸形/不可解析 JSON，400）、invalid_url、invalid_category、invalid_name、not_found、duplicate_category、protected_category、duplicate_url。校验错误不产生 5xx，不产生部分写入；畸形 JSON 一律 bad_request 且不写。\n39: - 状态合同：GET 幂等；写操作事务化；校验失败保持提交前状态；分类与 q 为视图状态；删除与恢复改变 trashed_at 但不删除行。\n40: \n41: ## UI/HTML 适配器合同（供真实表单验收与独立浏览器执行者）\n42: \n43: - `GET /`：保存表单 `form[action=/bookmarks/new]`（method=post，字段 url/title/description/category；category 预填「未整理」）；`a[data-testid=category-manager]` 指向 /categories；`form[data-testid=category-search-form]` 为 GET /，含 select 或 input name=category（归类名）与 input name=q；记录行 `tr[data-testid=record-row][data-record-id]`；打开链接 `a[data-testid=record-open-link]` 的 href 必须等于保存时原始 URL，target=_blank，rel 含 noopener；每行含 `form[data-testid=record-move-form]`（input record_id、select name=category_id，值为 API 归类 ID）、`form[data-testid=record-delete-form]`（input record_id）；回收站或 `GET /?trash=1` 的软删记录行含 `form[data-testid=record-restore-form]`（input record_id）。\n44: - `GET /categories`：`form[data-testid=category-create-form]`（input name）、`form[data-testid=category-rename-form]`（input category_id、name）、`form[data-testid=category-delete-form]`（input category_id）；每个归类行/侧栏计数为 `[data-testid=category-count][data-category-id=...]`，只显示活动记录数；归类名/计数与 JSON 一致。\n45: - 表单成功：save 303 到 /?category=...；move 303 到目标归类；delete 303 到 /?trash=1；restore 303 到恢复后归类；category create/rename/delete 303 到 /categories。失败：400/409 渲染当前页，含 `[data-testid=form-error]` 可读消息，保留 url/title/description/category/name/category_id/record_id 中已提交的值，并保留可重新提交的表单；不得 5xx 或写入。\n46: - 归类搜索：提交 category 与 q，成功后 URL 与表单同时保留两者；页面显示所选归类、保留的查询和匹配行；同一关键字在两个归类分别得到各自结果；某归类无匹配时显示明确空结果，不是错误。\n47: - 记录移动由 HTML 适配器把 category_id 翻译成归类名，再调用现有 move 服务；归类删除仍按 API 事务迁移活动与软删记录。默认归类不可重命名/删除。\n48: - P0 不提供孤立的记录编辑界面；仅保留 PATCH /api/bookmarks/{id} 的现有 URL 更新合同（URL 变化重算 hostname）。打开链接的实际导航目标由 href 与 /go 302 双重验证，不抓取目标页。\n49: \n50: ## 验收适配器合同\n51: \n52: - 全部程序使用 `--base-url` 指向真实 python-web 目标；A01/A05/A09 另需 `--app-root` 与 `--data-dir`，A14 需 `--data-dir`。\n53: - `--app-root` 只读；`--data-dir` 是测试者草稿根。重启用例通过 common.launch_app 在同一 `--data-dir/instances/<id>` 上启动 `app/serve.py`，真实写入、SIGTERM、同一目录重启并读回；健康检查不是重启证据。\n54: - HTML 用例以标准库 urllib 提交 application/x-www-form-urlencoded 表单并解析响应 HTML 的 data-testid、表单字段、链接与文本；不以 API 调用代替声明的 HTML 表单，不驱动 JS/DOM。独立浏览器执行者可复用同一契约。\n55: - 所有请求限定在 base_url 精确 origin；/go 不跟随重定向；不请求保存的外链、元数据或 favicon；不附加凭据；目标要求认证时显式报告基础设施未就绪。\n56: - 结果：stdout 单个 atlas.acceptance-result.v1 JSON；断言失败或基础设施错误 exit nonzero；不声称已运行。\n57: \n58: ## 非功能需求\n59: \n60: - 离线可用：保存/浏览/检索不依赖外部服务；不设置外部抓取为 P0 要求。\n61: - 数据完整性：写事务化；归类删除与恢复保持引用完整；校验失败零写入。\n62: - 确定性：排序、错误码、重定向稳定；GET 幂等。\n63: - 可访问/可测试：语义化 HTML、表单 label 或 aria、稳定 data-testid；服务端输出 UTF-8。\n64: - 单用户本机：无认证；日常 127.0.0.1，0.0.0.0 仅隔离验收网络。\n65: - 不设未经验证的时延/吞吐/成本目标；只要求请求可顺序处理。\n66: \n67: ## 边界与限制\n68: \n69: - 不实现云同步、多设备、协作、分享、浏览器扩展/移动分享目标。\n70: - 不保存网页副本、不抓取正文、不做失效链接检测（F17/F18）。\n71: - 不引入置顶/归档/多排序/复制 URL/访问计数（F20/F23/F24）。\n72: - 归类为扁平单选；嵌套/标签属后期（F19/D12）。\n73: - P0 不做重复拒绝；F14/A15 保持 P1。\n74: - 第三方元数据/图标仅 P1 可选增强，失败不影响保存；离线验收不验证其可达性。\n75: \n76: ## A04/A12 分类输入澄清（本次受限修订）\n77: \n78: - A04 仅分类管理：HTML create/rename 表单的 name 与 JSON create/rename 的 name 同为归类名称；省略、空字符串、纯空白、121 字符均 400 invalid_name，JSON 显式 null 同样 invalid_name。既有重名 duplicate_category、默认分类 protected_category、删除迁移/恢复均保留。\n79: - A12 仅书签保存和移动，不将分类管理 name 校验混为 invalid_category。HTML 保存使用名称 category；省略时未整理，显式空/纯空白/121 字符为 400 invalid_category。HTML 无 JSON null 这种原生值，不能把字面字符串 null 当 JSON null。\n80: - JSON 保存使用名称 category；省略或显式 null 均默认未整理，显式空/纯空白/121 字符为 invalid_category。JSON move 的名称 category 必填；省略、null、空/纯空白/121 字符为 invalid_category。有效新名称可自动创建并复用，未知名称不等于非法 ID。\n81: - HTML move 使用 category_id（API 已有分类 ID），必须解析为已有名称再调用服务；省略、空或未知 ID 为 invalid_category，不能把未知 ID 当新名称创建。JSON 保存/move 合同不新增 category_id 字段；GET category 未知值的空结果语义不改。\n82: - 错误分支一律零写入：HTML 400、form-error 可读、保留已提交字段并提供可重试表单；JSON 400、error.code/message/field，无导航。成功流程、303 导航、阶段、能力与既有断言意图保留。\n83: - 搜索仍仅对 title、hostname、description 做大小写不敏感子串匹配，并叠加分类；不扩展为 URL 全文、分类名或标签检索。此处对齐目标设计，不更改案例来源观察。"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\": \"/Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/application-atlas-production-pack/atlas/template-factory/jobs/job_7742b1c124be4c9ab3a0096da5cdd772/attempt-3/blueprint-spec-review-0-bbc43771a1bbbe99-runtime_protocol-v1/source/ARCHITECTURE.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1792432514572,"end":1792432515962}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1792432515963,"sessionID":"ses_eaab26edeffe6i68cx2YgCxL3M","part":{"partID":"prt_1554da761001L4JQxE4Dzm46G9","sessionID":"ses_eaab26edeffe6i68cx2YgCxL3M","messageID":"msg_1554d9f59001f40AnYC4VjprWQ","type":"tool","id":"call_02_8mv5vq3j10vp4goi8c301a67","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/application-atlas-production-pack/atlas/template-factory/jobs/job_7742b1c124be4c9ab3a0096da5cdd772/attempt-3/blueprint-spec-review-0-bbc43771a1bbbe99-runtime_protocol-v1/source/RUNTIME_CONTRACT.md"},"output":"Read file /Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/application-atlas-production-pack/atlas/template-factory/jobs/job_7742b1c124be4c9ab3a0096da5cdd772/attempt-3/blueprint-spec-review-0-bbc43771a1bbbe99-runtime_protocol-v1/source/RUNTIME_CONTRACT.md, lines 1-1\n1: Host isolation contract: each acceptance program runs directly in an independent Python or Node image, e.g. `python /suite/acceptance/x.py`; its working directory is not guaranteed to be `/suite`, so imports must be based on the program location or another explicit path. `app_root` is the read-only application source. `data_dir` is only the tester's mutable scratch directory at `/state`, never the application's database. The application and tester share only network access. Supported delivery profiles are exactly `python-web`, `node-web`, `static-web`, and `cli`; `web` is invalid. A web acceptance program must exercise the supplied `base_url`. Start commands are literal argv arrays: placeholders such as `{port}` or `{data_dir}` are not interpolated inside an argument. A process-restart acceptance claim needs a concrete adapter contract for launching the same frozen application from `app_root` as a dedicated process, with isolated per-instance scratch, doing real app actions, stopping that process, starting it again, and observing persisted app behavior. A new HTTP client or a database created by the tester does not prove app restart or persistence. A read-only external target that cannot be restarted requires separate external verification and must remain explicitly unverified for restart behavior; never claim a pass for it.","title":"read","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read file /Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/application-atlas-production-pack/atlas/template-factory/jobs/job_7742b1c124be4c9ab3a0096da5cdd772/attempt-3/blueprint-spec-review-0-bbc43771a1bbbe99-runtime_protocol-v1/source/RUNTIME_CONTRACT.md, lines 1-1\n1: Host isolation contract: each acceptance program runs directly in an independent Python or Node image, e.g. `python /suite/acceptance/x.py`; its working directory is not guaranteed to be `/suite`, so imports must be based on the program location or another explicit path. `app_root` is the read-only application source. `data_dir` is only the tester's mutable scratch directory at `/state`, never the application's database. The application and tester share only network access. Supported delivery profiles are exactly `python-web`, `node-web`, `static-web`, and `cli`; `web` is invalid. A web acceptance program must exercise the supplied `base_url`. Start commands are literal argv arrays: placeholders such as `{port}` or `{data_dir}` are not interpolated inside an argument. A process-restart acceptance claim needs a concrete adapter contract for launching the same frozen application from `app_root` as a dedicated process, with isolated per-instance scratch, doing real app actions, stopping that process, starting it again, and observing persisted app behavior. A new HTTP client or a database created by the tester does not prove app restart or persistence. A read-only external target that cannot be restarted requires separate external verification and must remain explicitly unverified for restart behavior; never claim a pass for it."}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\": \"/Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/application-atlas-production-pack/atlas/template-factory/jobs/job_7742b1c124be4c9ab3a0096da5cdd772/attempt-3/blueprint-spec-review-0-bbc43771a1bbbe99-runtime_protocol-v1/source/RUNTIME_CONTRACT.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1792432514913,"end":1792432515963}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1792432515964,"sessionID":"ses_eaab26edeffe6i68cx2YgCxL3M","part":{"partID":"prt_1554da8b0001Th36KFguGWBs27","sessionID":"ses_eaab26edeffe6i68cx2YgCxL3M","messageID":"msg_1554d9f59001f40AnYC4VjprWQ","type":"tool","id":"call_03_6jias5geqynumcgxygoanjlg","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/application-atlas-production-pack/atlas/template-factory/jobs/job_7742b1c124be4c9ab3a0096da5cdd772/attempt-3/blueprint-spec-review-0-bbc43771a1bbbe99-runtime_protocol-v1/source/REVISION.md"},"output":"Read file /Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/application-atlas-production-pack/atlas/template-factory/jobs/job_7742b1c124be4c9ab3a0096da5cdd772/attempt-3/blueprint-spec-review-0-bbc43771a1bbbe99-runtime_protocol-v1/source/REVISION.md, lines 1-1\n1: 仅消费绑定 failed job plan-1 的宿主受限补丁；保留原聚合修复范围和其余规格。独立设计/程序语义审阅、冻结模板审阅、正式发布与真实运行仍分别验收。","title":"read","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read file /Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/application-atlas-production-pack/atlas/template-factory/jobs/job_7742b1c124be4c9ab3a0096da5cdd772/attempt-3/blueprint-spec-review-0-bbc43771a1bbbe99-runtime_protocol-v1/source/REVISION.md, lines 1-1\n1: 仅消费绑定 failed job plan-1 的宿主受限补丁；保留原聚合修复范围和其余规格。独立设计/程序语义审阅、冻结模板审阅、正式发布与真实运行仍分别验收。"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\": \"/Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/application-atlas-production-pack/atlas/template-factory/jobs/job_7742b1c124be4c9ab3a0096da5cdd772/attempt-3/blueprint-spec-review-0-bbc43771a1bbbe99-runtime_protocol-v1/source/REVISION.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1792432515248,"end":1792432515964}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1792432515965,"sessionID":"ses_eaab26edeffe6i68cx2YgCxL3M","part":{"partID":"prt_1554daa0c001XI1gekT7tWV36h","sessionID":"ses_eaab26edeffe6i68cx2YgCxL3M","messageID":"msg_1554d9f59001f40AnYC4VjprWQ","type":"tool","id":"call_04_az58hue8scupectwkvipold6","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/application-atlas-production-pack/atlas/template-factory/jobs/job_7742b1c124be4c9ab3a0096da5cdd772/attempt-3/blueprint-spec-review-0-bbc43771a1bbbe99-runtime_protocol-v1/source/RESEARCH.md"},"output":"Read file /Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/application-atlas-production-pack/atlas/template-factory/jobs/job_7742b1c124be4c9ab3a0096da5cdd772/attempt-3/blueprint-spec-review-0-bbc43771a1bbbe99-runtime_protocol-v1/source/RESEARCH.md, lines 1-69\n1: {\n2:   \"gaps\": [\n3:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n4:     \"Behavior of Ripple TS reactivity primitives (track/effect/bindGroup/bindValue) at this pinned version was not\n5: validated.\",\n6:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n7:     \"Host excluded unsupported evidence inf-no-tests: Depends on a quarantined, unlocated observation\",\n8:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n9:     \"Host excluded unsupported evidence obs-no-test-files: observation cites an unknown source path: source/src\",\n10:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n11:     \"No automated tests exist in the manifest, so none of the described behaviors are test-confirmed.\",\n12:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n13:     \"Runtime behavior was not observed; all claims are static reading of source files.\",\n14:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n15:     \"The full commit tree was inferred from the supplied source_manifest and the on-disk source/ directory; files\n16: outside it were not inspected.\",\n17:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n18:     \"The paired Research Notes referenced by leaf.md were not supplied, so product-level evidence beyond the pinned\n19: repository is unavailable.\",\n20:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n21:     \"Whether Dexie/IndexedDB persistence behaves correctly in real browsers at this commit is unverified.\",\n22:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n23:     \"Whether the third-party metadata/favicon endpoints (api.microlink.io, images.weserv.nl, Google s2 favicons) are\n24: reachable, rate-limited, or CORS-permitted at runtime is unverified.\"\n25:   ],\n26:   \"summary\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_05babdea64ba9858 [code_observation]: New records are built with id\n27: `bm-${crypto.randomUUID()}`, hostname from getHostname(url), and defaults visitCount=0, visitedAt=null, isPinned=false,\n28: isArchived=false, createdAt=Date.now(); edits preserve the previous id, isPinned, isArchived, visitCount, createdAt, and\n29: visitedAt.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_06c81a165e03c96a [code_observation]: Pin/Unpin and Edit actions are rendered only when the\n30: item is not archived, and Edit loads the item's url/title/description/tags/favicon into the\n31: dialog.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_1596da4a90687ca5 [code_observation]: The Valibot BookmarkFormSchema requires a non-empty URL\n32: matching /^https?:\\\\/\\\\/(?:[\\\\w-]+\\\\.)+[a-zA-Z]{2,}(?:\\\\/\\\\S*)?$/ and v.url, a non-empty title up to 100 chars, a non-\n33: empty description up to 280 chars, and 1-5 tags each up to 30 chars.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_3168bcd465b6a043 [inference]:\n34: The scenario's user-controlled 'category' (归类) is realized only as up to five free-text tags on each record; there are\n35: no creatable, renameable, or nestable collections, and no separate move operation beyond editing\n36: tags.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_35e41aab676021eb [code_observation]: saveBookmark sets the record in the in-memory map then\n37: awaits db.bookmarks.put(bm); deleteBookmark removes from the map then awaits\n38: db.bookmarks.delete(id).\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_4c56ef30a1785be1 [code_observation]: A Delete action is rendered only for\n39: archived items; it calls deleteBookmark and shows an error-type toast with an Undo action that calls saveBookmark(item)\n40: to restore the record.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_6bbd7a588896fe31 [inference]: The scenario step of letting unclassified links\n41: land in a default category is not supported, because the form schema rejects saves with zero\n42: tags.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_7150b0ac7a5678db [code_observation]: A Copy URL action writes item.url to the clipboard and\n43: shows a success toast.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_7d47d725a2e9b759 [inference]: Metadata and favicon enrichment is best-effort\n44: and dependent on third-party HTTP services; failures degrade silently to console errors while the bookmark still saves\n45: with whatever fields the user entered or omitted defaults for.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_86ed2327f33a3ca8 [code_observation]:\n46: An effect on component creation calls db.bookmarks.toArray() and inserts each returned bookmark into an in-memory\n47: RippleMap keyed by bookmark id.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_8e11efc61a4650ba [code_observation]: On submit, if no favicon exists\n48: and a hostname is derivable, the code fetches a Google s2 favicon proxied through images.weserv.nl inside a try/catch\n49: that only logs failure.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_922f1dbc84912d99 [inference]: Persistence is local to one browser\n50: profile/device via IndexedDB with no sync layer, so the scenario's cross-session growth holds only on the same browser,\n51: and the leaf's multi-device context is unmet.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_93ef917a193a45ab [inference]: Deletion is limited to\n52: archived records and recovery is only the transient Undo action on the toast; there is no trash view, and non-archived\n53: records cannot be deleted at all through the UI.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_93ff254508846f11 [code_observation]: The Visit\n54: action builds an updated bookmark with visitedAt=Date.now() and visitCount+1, calls saveBookmark(updated), then opens\n55: the URL with window.open(item.url, '_blank', 'noopener,noreferrer').\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_9ab6b0e51811a16d\n56: [code_observation]: The displayed list filters by isArchived matching the active tab, requires every selected tag to be\n57: present in bookmark.tags, matches search only against bookmark.title.toLowerCase(), and sorts pinned-first then by the\n58: chosen sort mode with createdAt descending as fallback.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_b1ca64cf2ad02998 [code_observation]: The\n59: Archive/Unarchive action toggles isArchived and, when archiving, forces isPinned=false before\n60: saving.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_c4ad7e52e5713628 [code_observation]: Tag counts are derived by iterating all in-memory\n61: bookmarks and counting each tag occurrence, then sorted alphabetically for the\n62: sidebar.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_e62ae7e0a2c68ba1 [inference]: Retrieval by keyword covers only bookmark titles, not URLs,\n63: descriptions, or tag names, so the scenario's 'find by a remembered word' workflow is partially\n64: supported.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_e7dd8d32c05c39f9 [inference]: The app supports the scenario's save-now/find-later loop: a\n65: deliberate add dialog writes a URL-anchored record into durable IndexedDB, and the record can later be browsed, tag-\n66: filtered, title-searched, and opened back to the live URL.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_ec303a2fd1afa287 [code_observation]:\n67: fetchMeta calls https://api.microlink.io/?url=... and, on success with result.data, sets title/description and fetches\n68: the logo through https://images.weserv.nl/; errors are only console.error'd and the finally block resets loading.\"\n69: }","title":"read","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read file /Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/application-atlas-production-pack/atlas/template-factory/jobs/job_7742b1c124be4c9ab3a0096da5cdd772/attempt-3/blueprint-spec-review-0-bbc43771a1bbbe99-runtime_protocol-v1/source/RESEARCH.md, lines 1-69\n1: {\n2:   \"gaps\": [\n3:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n4:     \"Behavior of Ripple TS reactivity primitives (track/effect/bindGroup/bindValue) at this pinned version was not\n5: validated.\",\n6:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n7:     \"Host excluded unsupported evidence inf-no-tests: Depends on a quarantined, unlocated observation\",\n8:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n9:     \"Host excluded unsupported evidence obs-no-test-files: observation cites an unknown source path: source/src\",\n10:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n11:     \"No automated tests exist in the manifest, so none of the described behaviors are test-confirmed.\",\n12:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n13:     \"Runtime behavior was not observed; all claims are static reading of source files.\",\n14:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n15:     \"The full commit tree was inferred from the supplied source_manifest and the on-disk source/ directory; files\n16: outside it were not inspected.\",\n17:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n18:     \"The paired Research Notes referenced by leaf.md were not supplied, so product-level evidence beyond the pinned\n19: repository is unavailable.\",\n20:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n21:     \"Whether Dexie/IndexedDB persistence behaves correctly in real browsers at this commit is unverified.\",\n22:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n23:     \"Whether the third-party metadata/favicon endpoints (api.microlink.io, images.weserv.nl, Google s2 favicons) are\n24: reachable, rate-limited, or CORS-permitted at runtime is unverified.\"\n25:   ],\n26:   \"summary\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_05babdea64ba9858 [code_observation]: New records are built with id\n27: `bm-${crypto.randomUUID()}`, hostname from getHostname(url), and defaults visitCount=0, visitedAt=null, isPinned=false,\n28: isArchived=false, createdAt=Date.now(); edits preserve the previous id, isPinned, isArchived, visitCount, createdAt, and\n29: visitedAt.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_06c81a165e03c96a [code_observation]: Pin/Unpin and Edit actions are rendered only when the\n30: item is not archived, and Edit loads the item's url/title/description/tags/favicon into the\n31: dialog.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_1596da4a90687ca5 [code_observation]: The Valibot BookmarkFormSchema requires a non-empty URL\n32: matching /^https?:\\\\/\\\\/(?:[\\\\w-]+\\\\.)+[a-zA-Z]{2,}(?:\\\\/\\\\S*)?$/ and v.url, a non-empty title up to 100 chars, a non-\n33: empty description up to 280 chars, and 1-5 tags each up to 30 chars.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_3168bcd465b6a043 [inference]:\n34: The scenario's user-controlled 'category' (归类) is realized only as up to five free-text tags on each record; there are\n35: no creatable, renameable, or nestable collections, and no separate move operation beyond editing\n36: tags.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_35e41aab676021eb [code_observation]: saveBookmark sets the record in the in-memory map then\n37: awaits db.bookmarks.put(bm); deleteBookmark removes from the map then awaits\n38: db.bookmarks.delete(id).\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_4c56ef30a1785be1 [code_observation]: A Delete action is rendered only for\n39: archived items; it calls deleteBookmark and shows an error-type toast with an Undo action that calls saveBookmark(item)\n40: to restore the record.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_6bbd7a588896fe31 [inference]: The scenario step of letting unclassified links\n41: land in a default category is not supported, because the form schema rejects saves with zero\n42: tags.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_7150b0ac7a5678db [code_observation]: A Copy URL action writes item.url to the clipboard and\n43: shows a success toast.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_7d47d725a2e9b759 [inference]: Metadata and favicon enrichment is best-effort\n44: and dependent on third-party HTTP services; failures degrade silently to console errors while the bookmark still saves\n45: with whatever fields the user entered or omitted defaults for.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_86ed2327f33a3ca8 [code_observation]:\n46: An effect on component creation calls db.bookmarks.toArray() and inserts each returned bookmark into an in-memory\n47: RippleMap keyed by bookmark id.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_8e11efc61a4650ba [code_observation]: On submit, if no favicon exists\n48: and a hostname is derivable, the code fetches a Google s2 favicon proxied through images.weserv.nl inside a try/catch\n49: that only logs failure.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_922f1dbc84912d99 [inference]: Persistence is local to one browser\n50: profile/device via IndexedDB with no sync layer, so the scenario's cross-session growth holds only on the same browser,\n51: and the leaf's multi-device context is unmet.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_93ef917a193a45ab [inference]: Deletion is limited to\n52: archived records and recovery is only the transient Undo action on the toast; there is no trash view, and non-archived\n53: records cannot be deleted at all through the UI.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_93ff254508846f11 [code_observation]: The Visit\n54: action builds an updated bookmark with visitedAt=Date.now() and visitCount+1, calls saveBookmark(updated), then opens\n55: the URL with window.open(item.url, '_blank', 'noopener,noreferrer').\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_9ab6b0e51811a16d\n56: [code_observation]: The displayed list filters by isArchived matching the active tab, requires every selected tag to be\n57: present in bookmark.tags, matches search only against bookmark.title.toLowerCase(), and sorts pinned-first then by the\n58: chosen sort mode with createdAt descending as fallback.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_b1ca64cf2ad02998 [code_observation]: The\n59: Archive/Unarchive action toggles isArchived and, when archiving, forces isPinned=false before\n60: saving.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_c4ad7e52e5713628 [code_observation]: Tag counts are derived by iterating all in-memory\n61: bookmarks and counting each tag occurrence, then sorted alphabetically for the\n62: sidebar.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_e62ae7e0a2c68ba1 [inference]: Retrieval by keyword covers only bookmark titles, not URLs,\n63: descriptions, or tag names, so the scenario's 'find by a remembered word' workflow is partially\n64: supported.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_e7dd8d32c05c39f9 [inference]: The app supports the scenario's save-now/find-later loop: a\n65: deliberate add dialog writes a URL-anchored record into durable IndexedDB, and the record can later be browsed, tag-\n66: filtered, title-searched, and opened back to the live URL.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_ec303a2fd1afa287 [code_observation]:\n67: fetchMeta calls https://api.microlink.io/?url=... and, on success with result.data, sets title/description and fetches\n68: the logo through https://images.weserv.nl/; errors are only console.error'd and the finally block resets loading.\"\n69: }"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\": \"/Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/application-atlas-production-pack/atlas/template-factory/jobs/job_7742b1c124be4c9ab3a0096da5cdd772/attempt-3/blueprint-spec-review-0-bbc43771a1bbbe99-runtime_protocol-v1/source/RESEARCH.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1792432515596,"end":1792432515965}}}}
